<title>POLAND: Poland sells PLN 89 mln 1-year index-linked bonds.</title>
<headline>Poland sells PLN 89 mln 1-year index-linked bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland sold 89 million zlotys of one-year index-linked bonds after investors bid for 545 million zlotys and raised the minimum price to 94.48 from 93.50 at the last auction on January 28, the treasury said.</p>
<p>It said the average accepted price at the tender was 94.62, up from 94.10. The maximum price was 95.05.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
